  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Targets .NET 10 and .NET Standard 2.0; .NET Framework targets have been dropped. Breaking changes: command arguments are validated and quoted values escaped, so values can no longer inject extra commands; a command used before Connect() throws InvalidOperationException; a reply that times out throws TimeoutException and closes the connection; Disconnect() only sends LOGOUT after Login(). New: async versions of every command with cancellation, STARTTLS, a connect timeout, IPv6 addresses, thread-safe use from several threads, and UTF-8 replies.",
